{
  "Title": "ELSA-2026-97855:  nodejs:26 security update (IMPORTANT)",
  "Description": "nodejs\n[1:26.8.2-1]\n- Update to version 26.8.2\n\n[1:26.1.0-2]\n- Enable building with rust\n\n[1:26.1.0-1]\n- Rebase to nodejs 26.1.0\n- list new dependency: merve\n- Switch compiler from gcc-toolset-12 to clang/llvm\n- Add libatomic build dependency and linker symlink workaround\n- Replace -fno-ipa-icf with -fno-optimize-sibling-calls (clang compat)\n- Disable LTO (not yet supported with clang toolchain)\n- Export CC/CXX/AR/RANLIB for clang/llvm\n- Add LDFLAGS for libatomic search path\n- Add patch: Python \u003c3.10 compat (match/case to if/elif)\n- Add patch: v8 include climits for CHAR_BIT (clang strict headers)\n- Dropped downstream nghttp2 update patch\n- Removed corepack stuff\n\n[1:24.14.1-2]\n- Update bundled nghttp2 to 1.68.1\n\n[1:24.14.1-1]\n- Update to version 24.14.1\n\n[1:24.13.0-1]\n- Update to version 24.13.0\n\n[1:24.11.1-2]\n- Disable test-tls-session-cache.js as its not currently compatiable with\n  RHEL environment\n\n[1:24.11.1-1]\n- Update to version 24.11.1\n\n[1:24.4.1-7]\n- Add patch to prevent fips usage segfault\n\n[1:24.4.1-6]\n- Rename nodejs-npm back to npm\n\nnodejs-nodemon\n[2.0.3-9]\n- Let nodemon work with any Node.js version\n  Resolves: #2230317\n\n[2.0.3-8]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_39_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[2.0.3-7]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_38_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[2.0.3-6]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_37_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[2.0.3-5]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_36_Mass_Rebuild\n\nnodejs-packaging\n[2021.06-6]\n- Properly handle @group/package deps in nodejs-symlink-deps\n  Resolves: RHEL-121569\n\n[2021.06-5]\n- nodejs.req to properly detect bundled deps",
  "Platform": [
    "Oracle Linux 9"
